<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AppFlowy</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: #f5f7fb; color: #1c2430;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body { background: #12161c; color: #e7ecf3; }
    .card { background: #1b2129 !important; box-shadow: none !important; }
    .btn-secondary { border-color: #33404f !important; color: #cdd6e2 !important; }
    code { background: #0d1116 !important; }
  }
  .card {
    width: min(92vw, 560px); background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(20,40,90,.12); text-align: center;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 18px; margin: 0 auto 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(155deg, #285ecf, #6350e8);
    display: grid; place-items: center; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px;
  }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 24px; }
  p  { margin: 8px 0; line-height: 1.55; color: inherit; opacity: .85; }
  code {
    background: #eef1f6; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .92em;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .actions { margin-top: 26px; display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
  a.btn {
    display: inline-block; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(155deg, #285ecf, #6350e8); color: #fff; }
  .btn-secondary { border: 1px solid #d3dae5; color: #33404f; }
  .hint { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; opacity: .7; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="logo">AF</div>
    <h1>AppFlowy is running</h1>
    <p>Open the web workspace, or point a desktop/mobile app at:</p>
    <p><code>__APPFLOWY_BASE_URL__</code></p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="__APPFLOWY_BASE_URL__" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open AppFlowy</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://appflowy.com/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get the app</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hint">
      The web workspace is served at the URL above. Desktop &amp; mobile apps
      connect to the same URL (Settings → Cloud Settings → Self-hosted). This
      add-on bundles the API, authentication, realtime sync, object storage and
      the web front-end; the admin console and AI features are not included.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
